{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/H_B_AuMBiJDQ0kt3jV-6Zg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:32.057052+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/H_B_AuMBiJDQ0kt3jV-6Zg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tmBZ1gsWrQvWBjWHlp6o0GOoquJIzQHhOM7vN67oRcnTkGTMIgow3NdiacM4DPpx3oib7PToTibWC9XYsHSNLwZ7A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Oc4SdLvubNOSIDRLPW3UT2BGe8FkDfowHVomfIC5ULQWfDia4WUatRxCdVJibFA6qRFuyOKbybJicCycB3mb8nPA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/IBMGaQndKJV4dibL8AY4sxtcH2EibpBsEkeMr6CwM9ZxVuWaCQf1yELzbUfELupO9Qr714TOsFSwgs7ZUEtBAkRQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/HUZ1UA5FbzDbtl9LKLKbDMXspYA71jFsusdEoHKLSMnxEEJLRqyicFMNAALkpNE8pleichp82mB6ibdPEoRkF16wg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WFYOHftnWrXeKqcTHExrgGmvico0xmzefeyJQGTNodLMeYnSYmodhQg2xImLzLTGt9FaTqb1B9q73IRSIoSc5XA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Oc4SdLvubNOSIDRLPW3UT2BGe8FkDfoSPicyJMlrnW5ZCBXBZ1VQEWnliblTMW6zDKDDWOU73LpOJLEwWdgbHtA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Oc4SdLvubNOSIDRLPW3UT2BGe8FkDfoNr0OpUnBFV95vESvP62vM5Picr5ic7wv2S4HqGoXSnatNvR2kPibG8fEA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>2026年项目采取网上报名并提交电子材料方式接收申请，请符合申请条件的申请人（</span><span><strong><span>包括本校应届生</span></strong></span><span>）登录清华大学研究生申请服务系统（https://yzbm.tsinghua.edu.cn）填报信息，</span><span><strong><span>申请服务系统定于2025年7月1日12:00开放，2025年7月28日12:00关闭</span></strong></span><span>，如有变更将在清华大学研招网（https://yz.tsinghua.edu.cn）及时通知。</span><span><span>报名申请环节包含两个步骤：报名登记、提交材料。两个步骤均完成后表示报名申请成功，缺一不可。</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>招生学科/项目</span></strong></p><p><span>专业代码/名称 ：</span><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>085400 电子信息</span></span></strong></p><p><span>研究方向/项目名称 ：</span><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>人工智能</span></span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Oc4SdLvubNOSIDRLPW3UT2BGe8FkDfokFuEEEeU0420xdkiae2CeuopM2JxSMuveWaRpCKzlKsagaL6oPeXHlQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Mz7l3tjpxTQW42upRicSQpfJ1wibJ1mcP4PnJFMhaAiaYgEvVk3BTld0kbJ9MUhY9S5qNSiaI3kYGdGibb8PNuibNyMA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>NOTICE</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请信息</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/aWE2KfbB50mn3GibA08fFWzH9om2uXtqiboyJSsnmZ3RtnKibTZEqYj68omqaBgibpULNEJ50vYYLiccmhkOGFqsaKA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bYXD2J0uQFjfkxWjp1ufyN3StMgvF8KI6icHXulaWmEJrRKhJOj7hjDfmicFYAVViah9kseZJJsMGNoiayzjRcf8NA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/GACEfibnjQQHfYYpAyWqW7hIAdLbKsfIoRj1DgPXmhCl9T83VvBhDfyerBBLjm6IgG868YXJAcHv0S2CID4g2Cw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1. 在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2. 研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>3. 诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><span>4. 身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/GACEfibnjQQHfYYpAyWqW7hIAdLbKsfIoRj1DgPXmhCl9T83VvBhDfyerBBLjm6IgG868YXJAcHv0S2CID4g2Cw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 有效身份证明（二代居民身份证）</span></p><p><span>2. 在学证明（学生证）</span></p><p><span>3. 本人自述</span></p><p><span>4. 外语水平证明</span></p><p><span>5. 专家推荐信2封：申请人在线邀请两位与申请学科相关的副教授（含）以上职称专家在线填写推荐信。推荐专家按申请服务系统要求，在规定的时间内填写、上传专家推荐信。同时请专家在线完成推荐书后协助妥善保存推荐信原件，待后续接收通知将书面版寄至我院，或将书面版密封（在密封信封的封口骑缝处签字）交申请人寄至我院，寄送时间和地址另行通知</span></p><p><span>6. 本科学业成绩单（含学业排名证明）</span></p><p><span>7. 个人简历</span></p><p><span>8.人工智能相关科研经历和奖项证明文件（合并为一个PDF上传，根据重要性从高到低列出，首页附目录）</span></p><p><span><span>另：上述第2、5、6三项本校应届本科毕业生不需提供。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/GACEfibnjQQHfYYpAyWqW7hIAdLbKsfIoRj1DgPXmhCl9T83VvBhDfyerBBLjm6IgG868YXJAcHv0S2CID4g2Cw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 在规定时间内登录清华大学研究生申请服务系统，按要求填写本人各项真实信息。申请服务系统网址如下：                          https://yzbm.tsinghua.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span>2. 报考院系：</span><strong><span><span>清华大学深圳国际研究生院（599）</span></span></strong><span>；</span><span><span>专业代码/名称 ：</span></span><strong><span><span>085400 电子信息</span></span></strong><span><span><span>；</span></span></span><span><span>研究方向/项目名称 ：</span></span><strong><span><span>人工智能</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>3. 我院对通过复试并同意接收为推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生的优秀应届本科毕业生不再发放纸质版初步录取通知（接收函），初步录取结果请申请人查询我校研究生申请服务系统。申请人还需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节，具体网址和系统开放时间等内容后续将在清华大学研究生招生网另行通知（https://yz.tsinghua.edu.cn）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/GACEfibnjQQHfYYpAyWqW7hIAdLbKsfIoRj1DgPXmhCl9T83VvBhDfyerBBLjm6IgG868YXJAcHv0S2CID4g2Cw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>复审和录取</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>我校将在录取当年6月对所有拟录取的推免生进行资格复审。通过资格复审并经调档案审查合格后，方可被正式录取，予以发放录取通知书。未通过资格复审者，取消其研究生录取资格。</span></p><p><span><span>现对资格复审的要求规定如下：</span></span></p><p><span>1. 已完成本科培养方案规定的所有课程及实践环节的学分要求；</span></p><p><span>2. 本科最后一学年课程考核成绩不得出现不及格记录；</span></p><p><span>3. 自考生报名至入学报到之日，未受到任何处分（考生报名时间指在“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”提交志愿的时间）；</span></p><p><span>4. 本科综合论文训练（毕业设计）应为优良或80分（含）以上；</span></p><p><span>5. 我校研究生新生入学前获得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书；</span></p><p><span>6. 符合我院项目自定的不低于学校复审要求的标准。</span></p><p><span><span>注：考生报名时间指在“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”提交志愿的时间。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/GACEfibnjQQHfYYpAyWqW7hIAdLbKsfIoRj1DgPXmhCl9T83VvBhDfyerBBLjm6IgG868YXJAcHv0S2CID4g2Cw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事宜</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对在推免过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，免试读研资格无效，并通报申请人所在学校。</span></p><p><span>2. 所有申请材料和已缴纳的复试费不予退还。</span></p><p><span>3. 未尽事宜参见《关于清华大学2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名的通知》。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Oc4SdLvubNOSIDRLPW3UT2BGe8FkDfokFuEEEeU0420xdkiae2CeuopM2JxSMuveWaRpCKzlKsagaL6oPeXHlQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Mz7l3tjpxTQW42upRicSQpfJ1wibJ1mcP4PnJFMhaAiaYgEvVk3BTld0kbJ9MUhY9S5qNSiaI3kYGdGibb8PNuibNyMA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>CONTACT</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>咨询方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/aWE2KfbB50mn3GibA08fFWzH9om2uXtqiboyJSsnmZ3RtnKibTZEqYj68omqaBgibpULNEJ50vYYLiccmhkOGFqsaKA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UqnKTHcY3f0WXQf9y9dPIUETkF3aOiazyf7wnuj58ny4SrgEm7AXSmEJHjiapNxpibL0RyYUXqt5ToYiaxC6Vlx1Aw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招办咨询：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>邮箱：</span></p><p><span>zhaosheng@sz.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>电话：(86) 0755-26036460/6120</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UqnKTHcY3f0WXQf9y9dPIUETkF3aOiazyf7wnuj58ny4SrgEm7AXSmEJHjiapNxpibL0RyYUXqt5ToYiaxC6Vlx1Aw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>项目/学科咨询</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>蔡老师</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span></p><p><span>meai@sz.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span>（以“2026级推免咨询”为题发送邮件）</span></span></p><p><span>电话：(86) 0755-86717869</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>更多招生信息请关注：</span></span></p><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bYXD2J0uQFjfkxWjp1ufyN3StMgvF8KI1MSib76IO2AQ4VgAAFTFnAxhR3tvIJLPzaRZaxtgD58vjPsyPAXVAvA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span> 长按扫码关注 </span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"6135a762a07978bff742fe0ad8600471f27f87fdc26429e5d637c5caf6b2bc03","textLength":1816,"sourceSha256":"da8480aefaac3c75391252d0dd85ba6d0c1046d40bd3d32f114ffe726f22dff4","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f238c279be63d2ddd526","title":"2025年清华大学深圳国际研究生院SIGS电子信息（人工智能）2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:32.057052+00:00"}
